    "text": "1238\nProject Format\nRaster Dimension\nFrame Rate\nResolutions\nl\nDNxUncompressed RGB 12bit\n*\nl\nDNxUncompressed RGB 32bit\nfloat *\nl\nApple ProRes 4444\nl\nApple ProRes 4444 XQ\n4K DCI Full 4096 x 2160\n4096 x 2160\n23.976P\n24P\n25P\n29.97P\n30P\n47.952P\n48P\n50P\n59.94P\n60P\n100P\n119.88P\n120P\nYCbCr Color Space:\nl\nDNxHR LB\nl\nDNxHR SQ\nl\nDNxHR HQ\nl\nDNxHR HQX\nl\nDNxUncompressed 4:2:2 8bit *\nl\nDNxUncompressed 4:2:2 10bit\n*\nl\nDNxUncompressed 4:2:2 12bit\n*\nl\nDNxUncompressed 4:2:2 32bit\nfloat *\nl\nApple ProRes 422 (Proxy)\nl\nApple ProRes 422 (LT)\nl\nApple ProRes 422\nl\nApple ProRes 422 (HQ)\nRGB Color Space:\nl\nDNxHR 444\nl\nDNxUncompressed RGB 8bit *\nl\nDNxUncompressed RGB 10bit\n*\nl\nDNxUncompressed RGB 12bit*\nl\nDNxUncompressed RGB 32bit\nfloat *\nl\nApple ProRes 4444\nl\nApple ProRes 4444 XQ\n4K DCI Scope 4096 x 1716\n4096 x 1716\n23.976P\n24P\n25P\n29.97P\n30P\n47.952P\n48P\n50P\n59.94P\nYCbCr Color Space:\nl\nDNxHR LB\nl\nDNxHR SQ\nl\nDNxHR HQ\nl\nDNxHR HQX\nl\nDNxUncompressed 4:2:2 8bit *\nl\nDNxUncompressed 4:2:2 10bit\n35 Project Formats and Resolutions"
  },
