    "text": "1255\nProject Format\nRaster Dimension\nFrame Rate\nResolutions\n32bit float *\nl\nApple ProRes Proxy\nl\nApple ProRes LT\nl\nApple ProRes +\nl\nApple ProRes HQ\nRGB Color Space:\nl\nDNxHD 444 *\nl\n1:1 10b RGB *, +\nl\nDNxUncompressed 4:2:2 8bit\n*\nl\nDNxUncompressed 4:2:2 10bit\n*\nl\nDNxUncompressed 4:2:2 12bit\n*\nl\nDNxUncompressed 4:2:2\n32bit float *\nl\nApple ProRes 4444\nl\nApple ProRes 4444 XQ\nHD 1080p\n1920 x 1080\n60\nYCbCR Color Space:\nl\nDNxHD LB*\nl\nDNxHD TR *\nl\nDNxHD SQ *\nl\nDNxHD HQ *\nl\nDNxHD HQX *\nl\n1:1 *, +\nl\n1:1 10 bit *, +\nl\nDNxUncompressed 4:2:2 8bit\n*\nl\nDNxUncompressed 4:2:2 10bit\n*\nl\nDNxUncompressed 4:2:2 12bit\n*\nl\nDNxUncompressed 4:2:2\n32bit float *\nl\nApple ProRes Proxy\nl\nApple ProRes LT\nl\nApple ProRes\nl\nApple ProRes HQ\nRGB Color Space:\n35 Project Formats and Resolutions"
